                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:74255c0c-9557-4815-a863-78191125437f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthCtrlEcucPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Maps the Ethernet controller to zero or one ECUC partitions. The ECUC partition referenced is a subset of the ECUC partitions where the Ethernet driver is mapped to.</L-2>
